    <profile name="Mandiblaster" id="9e7b-1795-0925-caca" hidden="false" typeId="b399-8a1b-bf0b-c5b7" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="deb8-131d-bdcf-1376">Melee</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="24d8-2110-08fa-d844">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="25ce-028f-0aae-2855">-</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="d3f6-19e8-ac9e-ae13">Melee</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="492d-1f80-b777-26f2">Special attack made at +2 I in addition to the bearer&apos;s other attacks. Make one attack hitting on a 4+.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Laser Lance" id="27f9-3c84-52b4-04c7" hidden="false" typeId="b399-8a1b-bf0b-c5b7" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="deb8-131d-bdcf-1376">Melee</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="24d8-2110-08fa-d844">5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="25ce-028f-0aae-2855">5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="d3f6-19e8-ac9e-ae13">Assault 1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="492d-1f80-b777-26f2">Fired during the assault phase when the Shining Spears charge into combat and resolved before any close combat attacks are made. Any models killed by these attacks are included in combat resolution. Additionally, the weilder counts as Strength 5 in hand-to-hand combat.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Swooping Hawk Grenade Pack" id="39f3-5cae-9dad-1d5b" hidden="false" typeId="b399-8a1b-bf0b-c5b7" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="deb8-131d-bdcf-1376">n/a</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="24d8-2110-08fa-d844">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="25ce-028f-0aae-2855">5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="d3f6-19e8-ac9e-ae13">Large Blast</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="492d-1f80-b777-26f2">When a Swooping Hawk unit uses Deep Strike to deploy, it may also use its grenades. Place the Large Blast marker anywhere on the table and roll a Scatter dice. If the arrow is rollwed, the marker still moves D6&quot; in the indicated direction.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Web of Skulls" id="406d-fd46-0418-e383" hidden="false" typeId="b399-8a1b-bf0b-c5b7" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="deb8-131d-bdcf-1376">24&quot;</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="24d8-2110-08fa-d844">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="25ce-028f-0aae-2855">5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="d3f6-19e8-ac9e-ae13">Assault 1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="492d-1f80-b777-26f2">If the Web of Skulls hits, roll to hit the unit again. Continue rolling until the Web of Skulls misses or 4 hits were inflicted. No model in the target unit may ever be hit twice by this weapon. Additionally, in close combat the Web of Skulls is treated as a power weapon.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Staff of Ulthamar" id="edd9-682e-28b9-e212" hidden="false" typeId="b399-8a1b-bf0b-c5b7" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="deb8-131d-bdcf-1376">Melee</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="24d8-2110-08fa-d844">2+</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="25ce-028f-0aae-2855">1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="d3f6-19e8-ac9e-ae13">Melee</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="492d-1f80-b777-26f2">Allows Eldrad to cast an additional psychic power (including one he already cast this turn), or can be used in an assault, wounding on 2+ and ignoring armour saves. It cannot be used in both manners in the same turn.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Eldritch Storm" id="50a4-ee3b-91ec-3363" hidden="false" typeId="7279-038a-b87a-ed0c" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a08a-36f8-2fd3-b843">Instead of firing a weapon, place the large Ordnance Blast template on an enemy unit with 18&quot;. Each move touched by the templaces takes a Strength 3 hit. The target unit also takes a Pinning test. A vehicle touched by the template suffers a hit with 2D6 armour peneraton and are spun around to face a random direction.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Fortune" id="3df8-941a-8012-811d" hidden="false" typeId="7279-038a-b87a-ed0c" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a08a-36f8-2fd3-b843">Nominate one Eldar unit with a model within 6&quot; of the Farseer (which may be the Farseer&apos;s own unit). This unit may re-rolled any failed armour saves or cover saves unitl the start of the next Eldar turn.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Guide" id="d383-eb64-5ab7-c167" hidden="false" typeId="7279-038a-b87a-ed0c" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a08a-36f8-2fd3-b843">At the start of the Eldar turn, nominate one Eldar unit with a model with 6&quot; of the Farseer (which may be the Farseer&apos;s own unit). This unit may re-roll any missed shooting to hit rolls until the start of the next Eldar turn. If the unit is using a guess range weapon, you may re-roll the scatter dice if a &apos;hit&apos; is not the result of the first roll.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Mind War" id="83b2-29ce-9d18-02b5" hidden="false" typeId="7279-038a-b87a-ed0c" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a08a-36f8-2fd3-b843">Instead of firing a weapon, the Eldar player may choose any enemy model within 18&quot; of the Farseer and within line of sight. Both players roll a D6 and add the Leadership test of the respective models. For each point the Farseer wins by the target loses a wound with no normal armour saves allowed. If the scores are tied, or the Farseer scores less, then there is no effect.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Spear of Teuthias" id="b5de-e63c-de80-a7fe" hidden="false" typeId="b399-8a1b-bf0b-c5b7" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="deb8-131d-bdcf-1376">18&quot;/Melee</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="24d8-2110-08fa-d844">2+</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="25ce-028f-0aae-2855">-</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="d3f6-19e8-ac9e-ae13">Assault 1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="492d-1f80-b777-26f2">Always wounds on a 2+. Versus vehicles the armour penetration value is 2xS+1d6. A model may not use this weapon in both the shooting and assault phase of the same turn.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Destructor" id="8cc5-9daf-3100-4784" hidden="false" typeId="b399-8a1b-bf0b-c5b7" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="deb8-131d-bdcf-1376">Flame</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="24d8-2110-08fa-d844">5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="25ce-028f-0aae-2855">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="d3f6-19e8-ac9e-ae13">Assault 1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="492d-1f80-b777-26f2"/>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Enhance" id="4d75-e148-e135-7ceb" hidden="false" typeId="7279-038a-b87a-ed0c" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a08a-36f8-2fd3-b843">All models in the Warlock&apos;s squad, including the Warlock, add +1 WS and +1 I. Additional Enhance have no effect.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Executioner" id="ca79-8127-4045-b637" hidden="false" typeId="b399-8a1b-bf0b-c5b7" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="deb8-131d-bdcf-1376">Melee</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="24d8-2110-08fa-d844">User +2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="25ce-028f-0aae-2855">1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="d3f6-19e8-ac9e-ae13">Melee</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="492d-1f80-b777-26f2">May not be used to gain +1 A with a pistol or additional CCW. Ignores armour saves.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Powerblades" id="183d-c848-8cc2-2f0f" hidden="false" typeId="b399-8a1b-bf0b-c5b7" typeName="Weapon">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="deb8-131d-bdcf-1376">Melee</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="S" typeId="24d8-2110-08fa-d844">As User</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="25ce-028f-0aae-2855">1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="d3f6-19e8-ac9e-ae13">Melee</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="492d-1f80-b777-26f2">Models equiped with powerblades gets +1 Attack. This can be in addition to the +1 Attack for being armoed with an additional close combat weapon or pistol for a total of +2 attacks. Ignores all armour saves.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Biting Blade" id="4b51-8a9d-385e-7e4e" hidden="false" typeId="b399-8a1b-bf0b-c5b7" typeName="Weapon">
